rch</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Pugazhenthi</surname><given-names>U</given-names></name><name><surname>Benezra</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Knauf</surname><given-names>JA</given-names></name><etal></etal></person-group><article-title>DNA Profiling analysis of 40 human thyroid cancer cell lines reveals Cross-Contamination resulting in cell line redundancy and misidentification</article-title><source>J Clin Endocrinol Metab</source><year>2008</year><volume>93</volume><fpage>4331</fpage><lpage>41</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18713817</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1210/jc.2008-1102</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B16"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>bbas-Terki</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Blanco-Bose</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name><name><surname>Deglon</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Pralong</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name><name><surname>Aebischer</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Lentiviral-mediated RNA interference</article-title><source>Hum Gene Ther</source><year>2002</year><volume>13</volume><fpage>2197</fpage><lpage>2201</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12542850</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1089/104303402320987888</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B17"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Niu</surname><given-names>XW</given-names></name><name><surname>Peng</surname><given-names>ZH</given-names></name><name><surname>Feng</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Ma</surname><given-names>HQ</given-names></name><name><surname>Liu</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Yuan</surname><given-names>JY</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Mechanism of retinoid receptors in inhibiting proliferation and inducing a